\title{opendrg: Open, Portable Implementations of Hospital Casemix Groupers}
\description{
Re-implements hospital casemix grouping logic in R so that it can be run anywhere, without vendor binaries. Groupers are expressed as published logic tables plus a small evaluation engine, starting with the CMS Medicare Severity Diagnosis Related Groups (MS-DRG) grouper and, later, the NHS England HRG4+ groupers. Inputs and outputs are plain data frames so the package composes with the tidyverse and, eventually, with database backends through 'dbplyr'.
